# ============================================================================
# Foundry runtime state - NEVER TRACKED.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS: there were no ignore rules here at all, so a broad
# `git add -A tools/foundry` swept up live heartbeat files that had been
# deliberately left untracked. They then churn on every commit, which buries
# real instrument changes in noise and makes every diff look busy.
#
# THE RULE: instruments are tracked, what instruments EMIT is not. A pulse
# file, a watcher's seen-list and a census history are all reconstructed by
# their own tool on next run - there is nothing to preserve and every reason
# not to carry another lane's live process state in the history.
# ============================================================================
monitor-pulse*.json
.monitor_census_state.json
.librarian-watch/
*.tmp*
__pycache__/
